### request - Register User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test.user@email.com",
  "password": "U2VjdXJlUGFzczEyMyE="
}

### request - Login User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email":"test.user@email.com",
  "password": "U2VjdXJlUGFzczEyMyE=",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### request - Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "refreshToken": "<paste-refresh-token-from-login-response>"
}

### request - Forgot Password (dev: reset link is logged by LoggingEmailService)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@email.com"
}

### request - Reset Password (token from the logged reset link)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "resetToken": "<paste-password-reset-token>",
  "newPassword": "TmV3U2VjdXJlUGFzczQ1NiE="
}

### request - Verify Email (token from the logged verification link)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/auth/verify-email
Authorization: Bearer <paste-email-verification-token>

### request - Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <paste-access-token>

### request - Get Current User Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer <paste-access-token>

### request - List Users (Admin only, paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/all?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer <paste-admin-access-token>

### request - Current user's permissions (RBAC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/authorize/me/permissions
Authorization: Bearer <paste-access-token>

### request - Check a permission (RBAC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/authorize/check?resource=user&action=read
Authorization: Bearer <paste-access-token>

### request - Assign a role to a user (Admin only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/v1/authorize/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer <paste-admin-access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

"MODERATOR"
